  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqwQjHY.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3xlgCgv.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>Hellim Studios 呈现 - Create: World of Gears 整合包</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hellim's Projects 自豪地呈现这款整合包，它围绕 Create 模组精心打造。数十个精心挑选的附加组件让创新的可能性近乎无限。在这座机械奇迹之中，我们集成了大量生活质量（QoL）模组以提升生存体验。此外，我们还加入了数个在保持游戏核心精髓的同时增加深度与多样性的模组。与之相伴的还有与 Create 无缝衔接的模组，例如 Create Aeronautics、Create: The Factory Must Grow 以及 Create: Ultimate Factory。当然，我们也通过加入 Farmer's Delight、Sophisticated Backpacks 和 Storage Drawers 等模组来升华您的 Create 体验，确保提供全面且沉浸的游戏玩法。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">带着你的齿轮，驶向地平线吧..</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7u1sNQN.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>🔹包含大量附加组件！</strong> <br><strong>➖50+ Create 附加模组</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹通过 QoL 模组大幅优化了您的生存体验。</strong> <br><strong>➖30+ QoL 模组</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹配备性能优化与服务器支持模组，以低配置要求实现高性能运行。</strong> <br><strong>➖性能提升 30%，帧率提高 40%。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹全面支持光影。已通过最耗资源的光影包测试。</strong> <br><strong>➖平均配置下运行 Complementary Shaders（超高品质设置）最低可达 144 FPS。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BhH6Jd3.png\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>本项目整体采用“保留所有权利”许可协议。</li>\n<li>请将任何与整合包相关的问题、Bug 或建议通过我们的 Discord 服务器反馈给我们。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wdzAqcI.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>🔹性能优化模组</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ol style=\"padding-left:1em\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/achievements-optimizer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Achievements Optimizer</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alternate-current\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alternate Current</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badpackets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bad Packets</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badoptimizations\" rel=\"nofollow\">BadOptimization</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-fps-render-distance-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better FPS - Render Distance</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/client-crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Client Crafting</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clumps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clumps</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectivity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connectivity</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cull-less-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Less Leaves</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/debugify\" rel=\"nofollow\">Debugify</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-block-entities\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Block Entities</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-async-world-save-forge-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Async World Save</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fix-gpu-memory-leak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fix GPU Memory Leak</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immediately Fast</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">In